section.rule:
Format the comment as a JSON object with the issue number and the comment body:
{"issue": {number}, "body": "{comment text}"}
The comment text may include markdown. Escape any double-quotes inside the body text. Multi-line comments use "\n" for line breaks within the JSON string.

Direct closure via "gh issue close {number}" is only permitted when ALL of the following are true: 1. agent_permissions.auto_close is set to true in .starterpack/config.yaml 2. The context explicitly requires it (e.g., the issue is a confirmed duplicate, a won't-fix decision has been made, or the issue was created in error)
When both conditions are met: gh issue close {number}
If auto_close is false (the default), never call gh issue close — always close via PR body reference instead.
